# "Whenever another artifact you control is put into a graveyard from the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on Syr Ginger and scry 1." Bot1 casts Syr Ginger (two Moxen)
# and sacrifices Black Lotus for white mana: the trigger puts a +1/+1 counter on her (4/2) and scries 1 (the Plains stays on top). On turn 3 "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Syr Ginger:
# You gain life equal to its power" gains 4 (CR 113.7a: the power she had on the battlefield, counter included): 20 + 4 = 24. Her own death from the cost triggers nothing
# (CR 603.10a: "another"), so no scry is asked for.

